  "intro_en": "This is a fast track into Мир for a reader who already reads some Russian. In five chapters it retells the first part of the main course, the village of Berëzovka in 1913, with denser prose, the same characters and the period vocabulary of the time. Each chapter teaches its grammar formally in an English Урок with full Russian tables, and the exercises ask only for forms you have been taught. After Глава 5 you continue with Глава 11 of the main Мир, where the war begins.",
